<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
<title>Revisión del contrato · OpenAPI Contract Lab</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;font-family:Segoe UI,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#17283c;background:#f1f5f9}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}main{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:40px 24px 64px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#52657a}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px);letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:10px 0}h2{font-size:23px;margin:32px 0 16px}h3{font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;margin:14px 0}p{line-height:1.65}.muted{color:#52657a}.context,.finding,.empty{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7e0ea;border-radius:14px;padding:22px;margin:20px 0}.context dl{margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:55px 1fr;gap:10px 16px}dt{font-weight:600}dd{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr));gap:12px}.stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7e0ea;border-radius:12px;padding:18px}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2}.stat span{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:14px;color:#52657a}.notice{font-size:14px;color:#52657a;max-width:900px}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:30px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid #d7e0ea;margin-right:6px}.error{color:#9b2332;background:#fff0f2;border-color:#f5c8cf}.warning{color:#805400;background:#fff7e5;border-color:#ecd697}.info{color:#176247;background:#eaf7f0;border-color:#b8dfca}.unknown{color:#52657a;background:#eef2f6}.rule{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.finding p,.finding li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.detail-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#52657a;display:block;margin-bottom:4px}.details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px 28px}.details p{margin:8px 0}.message{border-left:3px solid #b9cadd;padding-left:14px}.locations{padding-left:22px;line-height:1.8;font-size:14px}.locations a{color:#235c9a;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}.locations a:hover{color:#142f51}.position{color:#52657a}.empty{padding:30px}.empty h3{margin-top:0}footer{font-size:12px;color:#52657a;margin-top:32px}@media(max-width:650px){main{padding:24px 16px 40px}.details{grid-template-columns:1fr}.context,.finding{padding:18px}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media print{body{background:#fff}main{padding:0}.finding{break-inside:avoid}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}a{color:inherit}}
</style>
</head>
<body><main>
<header><div class="eyebrow">OPENAPI CONTRACT LAB</div><h1>Revisión del contrato</h1><p class="muted">Informe local · {{.Engine}} {{.EngineVersion}}</p></header>
<section class="context" aria-label="Contratos comparados"><dl><dt>Base</dt><dd>{{.Base}}</dd><dt>Head</dt><dd>{{.Head}}</dd></dl></section>
<section aria-labelledby="summary"><h2 id="summary">Resumen</h2><div class="stats">
<div class="stat"><strong>{{.Counts.Total}}</strong><span>Hallazgos</span></div>
<div class="stat"><strong>{{.Counts.Errors}}</strong><span>Errores</span></div>
<div class="stat"><strong>{{.Counts.Warnings}}</strong><span>Advertencias</span></div>
<div class="stat"><strong>{{.Counts.Info}}</strong><span>Informativos</span></div>
<div class="stat"><strong>{{.Counts.Unknown}}</strong><span>Sin clasificar</span></div>
</div><p class="notice">El changelog incluye cambios que afectan a consumidores. Una lista vacía no implica contratos idénticos; los cambios solo de descripción no generan hallazgos.</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="findings"><h2 id="findings">Hallazgos</h2>
{{range .Findings}}<article class="finding">
<span class="badge {{.Tone}}">{{.Severity}}</span><span class="badge">{{.Compatibility}}</span>
<h3>{{.Number}}. {{.Explanation.Summary}}</h3>
<p class="rule">{{.RuleID}} · nivel upstream {{.UpstreamLevel}}</p>
<p><strong>{{if .Endpoint}}{{.Endpoint}}{{else}}No reportada{{end}}</strong>{{if .Section}} · {{.Section}}{{end}}</p>
<p class="message"><span class="detail-label">Mensaje de oasdiff</span>{{.Message}}</p>
<div class="details"><p><span class="detail-label">Impacto · {{.Explanation.Kind}}</span>{{.Explanation.Impact}}</p><p><span class="detail-label">Acción sugerida</span>{{.Explanation.Action}}</p></div>
<p class="detail-label">Ubicaciones</p><ul class="locations">{{range .Locations}}
<li><strong>{{.Side}}:</strong> {{if .Link}}<a href="{{.Link}}">{{.File}}</a>{{else}}{{.File}}{{end}}{{if .Line}} <span class="position">· línea {{.Line}}{{if .Column}}, columna {{.Column}}{{end}}</span>{{end}}</li>
{{else}}<li>Sin ubicación reportada.</li>{{end}}</ul>
</article>{{else}}<div class="empty"><h3>No hay hallazgos que mostrar.</h3><p class="muted">Revisa el alcance del changelog antes de concluir que ambos contratos son idénticos.</p></div>{{end}}
</section><footer>Generado offline. Clasificación de oasdiff conservada; las acciones son sugerencias de revisión.</footer>
</main></body></html>
